{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game requires<u> two players</u></strong> and uses in-game voice chat for communication. No additional software is needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/c0453880749b2f005a8457e1412cee6f.poster.avif?t=1773422987\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/c0453880749b2f005a8457e1412cee6f.webm?t=1773422987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/c0453880749b2f005a8457e1412cee6f.mp4?t=1773422987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Locations, Connected by You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together in separate locations, each filled with unique puzzles that only your partner can help solve. Every move depends on sharp communication through in-game voice chat. Can you crack the code and escape before time runs out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/8011648e47e52322c991f7ef0fa8d083.poster.avif?t=1773422987\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/8011648e47e52322c991f7ef0fa8d083.webm?t=1773422987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/8011648e47e52322c991f7ef0fa8d083.mp4?t=1773422987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-Op: Work together from separate locations, using items and puzzles to help each other progress. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline: Immerse yourself in a unique, fully voiced heist narrative. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game Voice Chat: Communicate like true professionals using an old-school walkie-talkie on a special, unhackable frequency. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere? Explore a mysterious secret bunker that holds anything but the ordinary.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/extras/4e716b85e61b5370c912c38c4f5b229a.avif?t=1773422987\" width=612 height=120 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387160?t=1773422987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387160?t=1773422987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/d2b72c9634d71937876f131f1327a30e74fd7165/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773422987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387160/d2b72c9634d71937876f131f1327a30e74fd7165/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773422987","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3387170,"d